In honor of Quake's 25th anniversary, [https://www.shacknews.com/ Shacknews] is doing their annual tournament a little bit earlier this year. Sign up now for your shot at the $10,000 prize pool!

Even if you don’t feel like entering you’ll be able to catch the whole thing live over on the [https://www.twitch.tv/shacknews Shacknews Twitch channel].

==Format==
* Timelimit: 10
* Fraglimit: 30

* '''Round 1 (64 Players):''' [[FFA]] (8 Players) on [[dm3]]
* '''Round 2 (32 Players):''' [[FFA]] (8 Players) on [[dm3]]
* '''Round 3 (16 Players):''' [[FFA]] (4 Players) on [[dm1]]
* '''Round 4 (8 Players):''' [[1on1]] on [[dm6]]
* '''Round 5 (4 Players):''' [[1on1]] on [[dm6]]
* '''Finals and bronze game (4 Players):''' [[1on1]] on [[dm4]]

