==The Boss fight==

One of the organizers of the tournament, Grover Sturbson, offered to double the prize money of the winner if the winner managed to get 50 frags within ten minutes in dm6 1on1 against him. Milton took the challenge and scored his 50th frag just over seven minutes into the game for a final score of 50-(-1). This was the first time anyone had managed to beat the boss in the history of the Great Quakeholio tournaments.

